          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ilyo lyonse Aroni akalaingila mu Muputule wamushilo, akalasendela amashina ya bamwana Israeli abaume pa mutima ayalembwa pali tumba uwakwishibilako pakupingula pakuti yakaleibukishiwa lyonse pa cinso cakwa Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:30"
          },
